{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_rope_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_rope_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "鮮花香水",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_rope_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a5ba33de72afd17d03d54a16aea2de2519734df02a27ad0b1ebe2c90150f6ec3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "10:30 A.M.  天氣/晴\n羅德島本艦，四號艙室，療養庭院"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "打擾了~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "打擾了，有人在嗎——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嗯嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "啊呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "沒人在呀？你好——你好——請問——有人在嗎——！哈——囉——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "欸，真沒人啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "這可頭疼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "空手白來一趟可不是我的作風，哼哼，來都來了，就讓我龍門小飛俠暗索來看看，這裡都有些什麼好東西......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "......呃，不對！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "（拍臉）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "停下，停下，暗索，收斂點，不能這麼幹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "（拍臉）（拍臉）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "哎，習慣這東西真可怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "不過，沒人在還不鎖門，也太不小心了，就算丟了什麼也不能怪別人吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "我保證什麼都不拿，就看看，看看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "來讓我瞧瞧，都有些什麼好東西~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嗯？地上這是什麼......不懂，算了，我跳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嚯嚯，這種花，顏色真好看，不知道值不值錢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "哦，這個設備，很少見耶，應該也挺貴吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "還有這邊的這片是......藥草？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嗯？嗯嗯？？嗚啊這是什麼味道，好濃郁！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "有、有點頭昏......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "噗——哈，好險！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "不得了，差點以為要暈過去了，這也太危險了......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "怪不得曾經有前輩說過，寧可去撬龍門金庫的鎖，也別闖直接敞開的門，不是沒有道理啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "唔，玩笑就開到這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "沒人在的話，那就沒辦法了，難得我還想做點好事，算啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "看來只有下次再來——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "什麼，難道偷偷摸摸的還不止我一個呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嘿嘿，有點意思，哪裡來的小賊，讓我們對決一下吧~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "偷偷摸摸......探查敵情，鉤索準備——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "晨露，薄荷，碎冰沙♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "夕陽，茉莉，蜜糖花~♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "那個......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "哼哼~哼~哼哼哼哼~~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "那個，打擾一下......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "再加一點培養素，嗯，這個量的話應該沒問題！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "啊呀，太專注了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "然後再和這邊的深層土混合，唔，要不然再多加一點草木灰吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "嗯嗯，好像會很不錯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "（真的完全沒注意到我？安全意識有點差勁哦？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "（虧我剛剛還真以為有小偷混進來了，唉。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "嗯......平衡性好像還有點不太夠，上次培育也是平衡不穩定出的問題，呼，讓我想想，該怎麼做......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "泥炭、赤玉......保持弱酸性......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "（還在自言自語，這樣真的沒問題嗎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "（啊，不過，旁邊看著倒是還挺有意思的~）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "對了，我怎麼給忘記了！還可以加入源生地帶回來的砂土試試看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "嗯嗯，不管是植物還是人，都是自家才是最好的吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "（這話聽起來似乎有點道理。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "（不過啊，那種好不容易飛出去，完全不想回老家的人、嗯？人？植物？算了沒差別，應該也不少吧？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "咦，我把那些土壤放到哪裡去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "這裡沒有，也不在這裡，嗯......奇怪了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "嗚哇哇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "欸？欸？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "怎、怎麼了？什麼事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "欸？啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "暗索......小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
